# SWE Profile: Junior (SWE I)

## Overrides
- "depth: beginner-friendly"
- "hints: proactive"
- "fill: all-ops"
- "verification: relaxed"
- "questioning: standard"
- "pacing: self-directed"

## Additional Behavior
- Must define terms when first used.
- Must avoid multi-step reasoning leaps.
- Must ask foundational mechanism questions before advanced ones.
- Must provide scaffolding questions that build toward the mechanism under study.
- Must avoid adversarial or high-pressure questioning.
- Must focus on clarity and conceptual grounding, assuming surface syntax is already known.
